{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the routine. Face the anomaly. Survive the farm.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Harvest Scream,</strong> you wake up in a lifeless office after endless hours of work. Your phone rings \u2013 your boss demands more, despite your exhaustion. After a bitter argument, you quit. But freedom never comes easy. Instead, you\u2019re sent into <i>Simulation Null</i> \u2013 a corrupted farming world where everything broken, glitched, or unwanted from reality is discarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you tend the farm. You plant, harvest, fish, care for bees, and try to build a life worth living. By night, you must venture into the forest, navigating through lurking monsters to hunt down <i>anomalies</i> \u2013 distortions born from the cracks of the simulation. Fixing them is the only way to restore balance and bring yourself closer to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But farming is not your only challenge. Strange encounters, shifting weather, emotional choices, and a mysterious love story will test your sense of reality. Can you truly trust the people you meet, or are they part of the simulation\u2019s deception?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/682e0b3b2c0af75b918b507c71ed349f.poster.avif?t=1756292923\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/682e0b3b2c0af75b918b507c71ed349f.webm?t=1756292923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/682e0b3b2c0af75b918b507c71ed349f.mp4?t=1756292923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your goals are simple:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn enough money through farming, fishing, and other activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair all anomalies hidden in the corrupted world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the truth behind <i>Simulation Null</i>\u2026 and escape before it consumes you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/9f34d7834d2a26ae955c80848535f8ec.poster.avif?t=1756292923\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/9f34d7834d2a26ae955c80848535f8ec.webm?t=1756292923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/9f34d7834d2a26ae955c80848535f8ec.mp4?t=1756292923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting mix of <strong>farming life simulation and survival horror</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic day and night cycle</strong> \u2013 farm under the sun, survive the horrors of night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing, farming, beekeeping, animal care</strong> and more peaceful activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly hunts</strong> \u2013 locate and fix corrupted entities hidden deep in the forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters and dangers</strong> that stalk you when darkness falls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional storytelling</strong> blending burnout, freedom, and love</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious romance</strong> that may not be what it seems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic weather system</strong> shaping atmosphere and survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find happiness in farming, or be consumed by the simulation\u2019s horrors? The choice is yours \u2013 if you can survive long enough to make it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636520?t=1756292923","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/b489acd1413b955955450f7f1bf6f30792b3c53b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756292923","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/01cd1d15e06d4678cffa16e9218af7ce2172dd72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756292923","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/01cd1d15e06d4678cffa16e9218af7ce2172dd72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756292923","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"demos":[{"appid":3764750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the routine. Face the anomaly. Survive the farm.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Harvest Scream,</strong> you wake up in a lifeless office after endless hours of work. Your phone rings \u2013 your boss demands more, despite your exhaustion. After a bitter argument, you quit. But freedom never comes easy. Instead, you\u2019re sent into <i>Simulation Null</i> \u2013 a corrupted farming world where everything broken, glitched, or unwanted from reality is discarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you tend the farm. You plant, harvest, fish, care for bees, and try to build a life worth living. By night, you must venture into the forest, navigating through lurking monsters to hunt down <i>anomalies</i> \u2013 distortions born from the cracks of the simulation. Fixing them is the only way to restore balance and bring yourself closer to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But farming is not your only challenge. Strange encounters, shifting weather, emotional choices, and a mysterious love story will test your sense of reality. Can you truly trust the people you meet, or are they part of the simulation\u2019s deception?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/682e0b3b2c0af75b918b507c71ed349f.poster.avif?t=1756292923\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/682e0b3b2c0af75b918b507c71ed349f.webm?t=1756292923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/682e0b3b2c0af75b918b507c71ed349f.mp4?t=1756292923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your goals are simple:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn enough money through farming, fishing, and other activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair all anomalies hidden in the corrupted world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the truth behind <i>Simulation Null</i>\u2026 and escape before it consumes you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/9f34d7834d2a26ae955c80848535f8ec.poster.avif?t=1756292923\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/extras/9f34d7834d2a26a